{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Storytelling", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "The Miserly Rich Man", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 7, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 8, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Describe hypothetical situations in written and spoken interactions according to work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "  Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn9le08ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Simple Past Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Simple Past tense to talk about many kinds of past events: short, quickly finished actions, longer situations and repeated events. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Usually, when you use the Simple Past tense, the time of the finished action is clear from the context or explicitly mentioned in the sentence.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">When they had arrived at the wealthy man's house, they <span class=\"strong\">went to bed</span> because it was dark.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can use the Simple Past with the <span class=\"underline\">Past Perfect</span> to talk about the action that happened in the more recent past. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">The rich man had walked over confidently and <span class=\"strong\">offered</span> him fifty cents a day. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "In this case, the action of \u201coffering\u201d happened in the most recent past, after the action of \u201cwalking over\u201d.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can use the Simple Past with the <span class=\"underline\">Past Continuous</span> to talk about an action that interrupted another action in progress in the past. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">While the simple man was eating, the rich man <span class=\"strong\">told</span> him that he was working out in the fields for the day.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The event of \u201ctelling\u201d interrupts the action of \u201ceating\u201d. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Remember that there are both regular and irregular verbs. Look at the chart for examples of the Simple Past tense verbs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Regular Verbs</span>:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"explain\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"explained\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"smile\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"smiled\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Irregular Verbs</span>:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tell\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"told\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" is/are\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" was/were\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "While the simple man was eating, the rich man told him that he was working out in the fields for the day.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The rich man was happy.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "He also explained slyly that it was too far to come back for lunch.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The simple man humbly agreed and ate his supper.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The simple man smiled mischievously.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Past Perfect Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Past Perfect tense to identify and talk about an 'earlier past'.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you are talking about a past event, you can refer to something that happened at an earlier time to that past event by using the Past Perfect tense.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The structure of the Past Perfect is:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Subject + had + past participle<br/>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">When I <span class=\"strong\">arrived </span>at the party, Vanessa <span class=\"strong\">had</span> already <span class=\"strong\">gone</span> home. </span><br/>Which event happened <span class=\"italic\">first</span>? Vanessa went home.<br/>Which event happened <span class=\"italic\">later</span>? I arrived at the party. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">When they <span class=\"strong\">had arrived</span> at the wealthy man's house, they <span class=\"strong\">went</span> to bed because it was dark.</span><br/>Which event happened <span class=\"italic\">first</span>? They arrived at the house.<br/>Which event happened <span class=\"italic\">later</span>? They went to bed.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "He had thought carefully about jobs that would require the man to work far harder than he should for the money.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Just as he had finished, the rich man told him to go to work. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The rich man had walked over confidently and offered him fifty cents a day. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "wealthy ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "rich", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There once was a wealthy man.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le08ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you hear in a tale about a miserly rich man.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "simple-looking", "type": "name"}, {"content": " looking very plain; dressed very simply ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: A simple-looking man on the street had caught his eye.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le08ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "confidently", "type": "name"}, {"content": "feeling or showing certainty", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The rich man had walked over confidently.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le08ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "slyly", "type": "name"}, {"content": "cleverly in a dishonest way", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He also explained slyly that it was too far to come back for lunch.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le08ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "humbly", "type": "name"}, {"content": "in a simple and unpretentious way", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The simple man humbly agreed and ate his supper.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le08ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "mischievously", "type": "name"}, {"content": "in a playful way meant to cause trouble", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The simple man smiled mischievously.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le08ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Write a dialogue between two people.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "One person is telling the other how they were or were almost tricked or scammed.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Talk about what happened or had happened.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Mention reactions and behavior in these situations.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your dialogue aloud with a partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write a dialogue between two people about a trick or scam.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use the Simple Past tense and the Past Perfect tense.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I describe reactions and behavior.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read the dialogue aloud with a partner.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"_data": [{"