Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn9le08ob07re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "There once was a wealthy man. He had always tried to find ways to save money by tricking the men who worked for him. One day he was looking for somebody to work for him.<br/><br/>A simple-looking man  on the street had caught his eye. The rich man had walked over confidently and offered him fifty cents a day. The simple man had agreed. The rich man was happy. He had thought carefully about jobs that would require the man to work far harder than he should for the money.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn9le08ob07re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "When they had arrived at the wealthy man's house, they went to bed because it was dark. In the morning, the rich man sent the simple fellow for breakfast. While the simple man was eating, the rich man told him that he was working out in the fields for the day. He also explained slyly that it was too far to come back for lunch.<br/><br/>So, the rich man's wife kindly served the man lunch. While the simple man was  eating, the employer asked him if he wanted to eat his supper too. Then, he could come back late.", "id": 2, "time": "29900", "image": "engenn9le08ob07re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "The simple man humbly agreed and ate his supper. Just as he had finished, the rich man told him to go to work.<br/><br/>The simple man smiled mischievously and said \"With all due respect, sir, I cannot go to work now. All my life I've gone to sleep after supper, and I'm not going to change now.\"", "id": 3, "time": "61500", "image": "engenn9le08ob07re2img03.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn9le08ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le08ob07re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}